# Normalise line endings so a CRLF rewrite never buries a real change in a
# whole-file diff. This repo stores sources as LF; several security PRs have
# produced 700-1200 line diffs for a handful of changed lines without it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
